てもらえませんか？黒髪の方は真面目でタバコをよく吸うのですが、銀髪の方はのんびりしていて、友達と冗談を言い合うのが好きです。二人はお互いを思いやり、恋する相性もあるが、その恋愛は親しい友情の中にある。\n黒髪： https://imgur.com/a/PYFzwjn\n銀髪： https://imgur.com/a/alexis-2-Iz93bJD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Wawon_illust/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aec37662/uploads/origins/caec0ca3-ed13-4f18-9477-128c3f849601?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c41b078ba13200f44da5599e103ddc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aec37662/uploads/origins/caec0ca3-ed13-4f18-9477-128c3f849601?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c41b078ba13200f44da5599e103ddc3, https://si.imgix.net/aec37662/uploads/origins/caec0ca3-ed13-4f18-9477-128c3f849601?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a67798a3051a72da93191d02390d8779 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aec37662/uploads/origins/caec0ca3-ed13-4f18-9477-128c3f849601?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d79014028df00a00de7d3dae8b701183 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n I want you to draw GUILTY GEAR Xrd sin kiske.\n\nYour illustrations are very nice, so I'll leave it to you except for the characters.\n\nUse it for icons such as your own SNS.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Wawon_illust/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4193bbd7/uploads/origins/e5cdc05a-73f6-43ed-a4c7-5c9d9bdac24c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2ca1806259e735d680c0efe142998ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4193bbd7/uploads/origins/e5cdc05a-73f6-43ed-a4c7-5c9d9bdac24c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2ca1806259e735d680c0efe142998ce, https://si.imgix.net/4193bbd7/uploads/origins/e5cdc05a-73f6-43ed-a4c7-5c9d9bdac24c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=625039fab9644ade1a633628ca038836 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4193bbd7/uploads/origins/e5cdc05a-73f6-43ed-a4c7-5c9d9bdac24c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3c44a1e383fe8fd3ca515aab24d6aea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "君のアートスタイルが大好きなんだ！\n\n私のキャラクター、ジーンを描いてほしいです！\n\n彼女の表情は、鋭い歯を見せた自信に満ちた笑みで、できれば武器を横に置いて座っているような感じでお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/gene-rozeluxe-5-21-25-ENjZWcC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Wawon_illust/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5cb63343/uploads/origins/53d3e1bb-d345-4bab-a6fe-ee37c41fc0d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7fb20e1143fdda4a3a8351f0bcdf916", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5cb63343/uploads/origins/53d3e1bb-d345-4bab-a6fe-ee37c41fc0d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7fb20e1143fdda4a3a8351f0bcdf916, https://si.imgix.net/5cb63343/uploads/origins/53d3e1bb-d345-4bab-a6fe-ee37c41fc0d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3055c797bad4590770d41f32631d299 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5cb63343/uploads/origins/53d3e1bb-d345-4bab-a6fe-ee37c41fc0d1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26238f3cec46010e63fbfd4abfb2aa0c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、Wawon！あなたのアートスタイルの大ファンです。アンダーナイトのカーマインを、僕がゲーム内で使っているカスタムカラーで描いてもらえると嬉しいです！https://i.imgur.com/nWvCkCX.png & https://i.imgur.com/Gjg3Wz9.png 。できれば、彼がスーパーアタック（https://i.imgur.com/gUfeLnc.png）をするときにこのポーズをとってほしいです。\n\n私はむしろあなたが創造的な自由を持っていることを望みます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Wawon_illust/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/44c0920c/uploads/origins/e657cad2-6cbc-45ef-85a2-2ba1be16fb87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16af9c28d294d107b6aa6ff1d71565fb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/44c0920c/uploads/origins/e657cad2-6cbc-45ef-85a2-2ba1be16fb87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16af9c28d294d107b6aa6ff1d71565fb, https://si.imgix.net/44c0920c/uploads/origins/e657cad2-6cbc-45ef-85a2-2ba1be16fb87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98e01616d2e50476eb6db11201c3085c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/44c0920c/uploads/origins/e657cad2-6cbc-45ef-85a2-2ba1be16fb87?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdf76aac2434c89712875b297adf040f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "PSO2NGSのOCを描いてくれる\nをお願いしたいのですが、姿勢などはお任せします。\n\n身長は低いはずなので、少し見上げるような感じでお願いします。\n\nまた、できれば、ドヤ顔と自信満々顔の2種類の表情バリエーションが欲しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1hJ8Fl7h0Ng-6qtogIUi2fwUW61QW-BSm/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_o_j17n4FPBgS_u5ZoFFjOPq7UkgJxCh/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vUOxxzr6bK6D1fQgUQ3ZQ_GTPqJG1WFN?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1C4XeoVCNyHtlL2XCPAos_Cr7Ht1n0OiG/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://1drv.ms/u/c/438a639fb1d2f681/EeLugNtTH9ZGmF9gLUKX-bsBDJp-PiYyaAlcZDHc34c1bA?e=2pvTef", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Wawon_illust/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c85c4a4/uploads/origins/bba30fba-f33c-4ac6-b69d-3e1ac361470c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5fbc117bcc6ef73570de0ae08061faa6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c85c4a4/uploads/origins/bba30fba-f33c-4ac6-b69d-3e1ac361470c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5fbc117bcc6ef73570de0ae08061faa6, https://si.imgix.net/1c85c4a4/uploads/origins/bba30fba-f33c-4ac6-b69d-3e1ac361470c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c42bfc90e297795eafe021bfb13f6d1c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c85c4a4/uploads/origins/bba30fba-f33c-4ac6-b69d-3e1ac361470c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c8eb54f290aaa24ea2c59136099560e 3x", "genre": "art", "